# Hidden setup shared by the tapes that skip the opening (launched with --lang en, so no language screen):
# New run, Normal, "Alex", Warrior, auto-equip on, first fight.
Type "2"
Sleep 300ms
Type "2"
Sleep 300ms
Type "Alex"
Enter
Sleep 300ms
Type "1"
Sleep 300ms
Type "1"
Sleep 500ms
Type "0"
Sleep 1s
